{"about_the_game":"A game created by a small indie team of 4, with burning passion and love for Action RPG games and ANIME!!<br><br><strong>Epic Conquest 2</strong> is inspired by traditional RPGs we used to play back in the old days. It's also the sequel of our previous game (with the same title) on mobile that captivated millions of players! But don't be afraid to jump right into this game because it won't be too much related to the first game anyway.<br><br>So, what's so good about Epic Conquest 2?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT MECHANICS THAT FEELS JUST AMAZING!</h2>Fluid control and movements, responsive input, and satisfying attack hits! You'll enjoy slaying the enemies it doesn't feel like a lot of grinding. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/8807e12196f008f859d7054558c5a034.poster.avif?t=1604669866\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/8807e12196f008f859d7054558c5a034.webm?t=1604669866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/8807e12196f008f859d7054558c5a034.mp4?t=1604669866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Challenging boss fights with Unique behaviors to learn.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VARIOUS CHARACTER BUILDS. DECIDE HOW YOU PLAY EACH CHARACTER.</h2>Although this might not be visible yet earlier in the game, <strong>Epic Conquest 2</strong> provides freedom when it comes to building a character. From the stats allocation, skills, and equipments, every decision matters!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each playable character in <strong>Epic Conquest 2</strong> comes with 8 Active Skills and 8 Masteries. You have to choose which suits your play-style.<br></li><li>Classic Status allocation upon leveling up! Manually allocate the points to increase attributes (<strong>STR/INT/DEX/AGI/VIT</strong>) to fit your build.<br></li><li>Wide-Range of Equipment options you can customize and further strengthen your preferred style.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A REWARDING OPEN-WORLD EXPLORATION</h2>Treasure Chests, Hidden items, Crafting materials. Good things come to those who explore! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/dfa3252d46b95151f21197b03ec930cf.poster.avif?t=1604669866\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/dfa3252d46b95151f21197b03ec930cf.webm?t=1604669866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/dfa3252d46b95151f21197b03ec930cf.mp4?t=1604669866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Stealing other people's belonging is bad, unless you're the Main Character of a JRPG.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ANIME-STYLE STORY WRITING WITH LOVABLE CHARACTERS</h2>Weebs, Rejoice! <strong>Epic Conquest</strong> has anime-style story that is done right! With cutscenes and character expressions to enrich the story telling, you'll always want to see the next episodes!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/582a87414a35b7ced0ea3449f855534e.poster.avif?t=1604669866\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/582a87414a35b7ced0ea3449f855534e.webm?t=1604669866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/582a87414a35b7ced0ea3449f855534e.mp4?t=1604669866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/fc7430904144d5e0c0d0c14cc05f40c9.avif?t=1604669866\" width=600 height=246 /></span><br><i>Childhood friends, Careless Onee-san, Ara-ara intensifies, and other tropes. Also, there's still more waifus to come.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMMUNITY-DRIVEN DEVELOPMENT</h2>While it's in <strong>Early Access</strong> until somewhere around the end of 2021, we're open to any feedback. And the game updates will be influenced by the discussion within the community. But of course, we still have more control to give you the surprise!<br><br>So, don't forget to join the conversation! Together we can shape <strong>Epic Conquest 2</strong> to be better!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"c241d247f3903d6ddb266e6ccb976ac24f4b46f9.jpg","localized_name":"Getting Started!","name":"Getting Started!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1235360/c241d247f3903d6ddb266e6ccb976ac24f4b46f9.jpg"},{"icon":"ae20463dbbe3376b2d434c50dd3049c93c6bfd19.jpg","localized_name":"Into the Unknown","name":"Into the Unknown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1235360/ae20463dbbe3376b2d434c50dd3049c93c6bfd19.jpg"},{"icon":"553a3f37a859d9520144b654caad1209948db7ba.jpg","localized_name":"Found the Secret Chest!","name":"Found the Secret Chest!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1235360/553a3f37a859d9520144b654caad1209948db7ba.jpg"},{"icon":"1ca1eba5cfe3ac40b8b8cfbfb2a57ce8fa24af98.jpg","localized_name":"Start Gathering!","name":"Start Gathering!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1235360/1ca1eba5cfe3ac40b8b8cfbfb2a57ce8fa24af98.jpg"},{"icon":"6f42b4b55a7757911d93e2f9a5ff3afb3b4eabbe.jpg","localized_name":"Clang Clang!","name":"Clang Clang!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1235360/6f42b4b55a7757911d93e2f9a5ff3afb3b4eabbe.jpg"},{"icon":"c507e7b6eed971796a793cef27c1f74e0532fe51.jpg","localized_name":"I'm growing up!","name":"I'm growing up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1235360/c507e7b6eed971796a793cef27c1f74e0532fe51.jpg"},{"icon":"6a586625ff984a9e95c80593479d725d9f185f1b.jpg","localized_name":"Gathering Pro","name":"Gathering Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1235360/6a586625ff984a9e95c80593479d725d9f185f1b.jpg"},{"icon":"5e386fa09ae79e9c369524ab61c8919fa2cde71a.jpg","localized_name":"Gathering Expert","name":"Gathering Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1235360/5e386fa09ae79e9c369524ab61c8919fa2cde71a.jpg"},{"icon":"dce47829457f0ff8840265ee0dffdd9839a73fd8.jpg","localized_name":"Gathering Guru","name":"Gathering Guru","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1235360/dce47829457f0ff8840265ee0dffdd9839a73fd8.jpg"},{"icon":"cb683a8993814469338cd2f868fa97dd07d67a97.jpg","localized_name":"Hunter","name":"Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1235360/cb683a8993814469338cd2f868fa97dd07d67a97.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1235360?t=1604669866","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1604669866","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1604669866","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1604669866","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Notice</h1><p>This game is best experienced with controller.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>A game created by a small indie team of 4, with burning passion and love for Action RPG games and ANIME!!<br><br><strong>Epic Conquest 2</strong> is inspired by traditional RPGs we used to play back in the old days. It's also the sequel of our previous game (with the same title) on mobile that captivated millions of players! But don't be afraid to jump right into this game because it won't be too much related to the first game anyway.<br><br>So, what's so good about Epic Conquest 2?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT MECHANICS THAT FEELS JUST AMAZING!</h2>Fluid control and movements, responsive input, and satisfying attack hits! You'll enjoy slaying the enemies it doesn't feel like a lot of grinding. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/8807e12196f008f859d7054558c5a034.poster.avif?t=1604669866\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/8807e12196f008f859d7054558c5a034.webm?t=1604669866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/8807e12196f008f859d7054558c5a034.mp4?t=1604669866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Challenging boss fights with Unique behaviors to learn.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VARIOUS CHARACTER BUILDS. DECIDE HOW YOU PLAY EACH CHARACTER.</h2>Although this might not be visible yet earlier in the game, <strong>Epic Conquest 2</strong> provides freedom when it comes to building a character. From the stats allocation, skills, and equipments, every decision matters!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each playable character in <strong>Epic Conquest 2</strong> comes with 8 Active Skills and 8 Masteries. You have to choose which suits your play-style.<br></li><li>Classic Status allocation upon leveling up! Manually allocate the points to increase attributes (<strong>STR/INT/DEX/AGI/VIT</strong>) to fit your build.<br></li><li>Wide-Range of Equipment options you can customize and further strengthen your preferred style.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A REWARDING OPEN-WORLD EXPLORATION</h2>Treasure Chests, Hidden items, Crafting materials. Good things come to those who explore! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/dfa3252d46b95151f21197b03ec930cf.poster.avif?t=1604669866\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/dfa3252d46b95151f21197b03ec930cf.webm?t=1604669866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/dfa3252d46b95151f21197b03ec930cf.mp4?t=1604669866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Stealing other people's belonging is bad, unless you're the Main Character of a JRPG.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ANIME-STYLE STORY WRITING WITH LOVABLE CHARACTERS</h2>Weebs, Rejoice! <strong>Epic Conquest</strong> has anime-style story that is done right! With cutscenes and character expressions to enrich the story telling, you'll always want to see the next episodes!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/582a87414a35b7ced0ea3449f855534e.poster.avif?t=1604669866\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/582a87414a35b7ced0ea3449f855534e.webm?t=1604669866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/582a87414a35b7ced0ea3449f855534e.mp4?t=1604669866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/extras/fc7430904144d5e0c0d0c14cc05f40c9.avif?t=1604669866\" width=600 height=246 /></span><br><i>Childhood friends, Careless Onee-san, Ara-ara intensifies, and other tropes. Also, there's still more waifus to come.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMMUNITY-DRIVEN DEVELOPMENT</h2>While it's in <strong>Early Access</strong> until somewhere around the end of 2021, we're open to any feedback. And the game updates will be influenced by the discussion within the community. But of course, we still have more control to give you the surprise!<br><br>So, don't forget to join the conversation! Together we can shape <strong>Epic Conquest 2</strong> to be better!","developers":["Gaco Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235360/header.jpg?t=1604669866","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1235360/274868/99ebbc8ebc9e2c17cf28bf2460355a9d7aac78d1/1751207928/dash_av1.mpd?t=1585721665","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1235360/274868/99ebbc8ebc9e2c17cf28bf2460355a9d7aac78d1/1751207928/dash_h264.mpd?t=1585721665","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1235360/274868/99ebbc8ebc9e2c17cf28bf2460355a9d7aac78d1/1751207928/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1585721665","id":256779525,"name":"Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256779525/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1585721665"}],"name":"Epic Conquest 2","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows\u00ae 7 SP1 / 8.1 / 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Proc